[3Glamp.[9GEvery[15Gnight,[22Gthe[26Gbeam[31Gswept[37Gacross[44Gthe[48Gblack[54Gwater,[61Ga[63Gpale[68Gfinger[75Greaching[84Gfor[88Gships[94Gthat[99Gmight[105Gbe[108Glost.

[3GWhen[8Gthe[12Gautomated[22Gbuoys[28Garrived,[37Gthe[41GCoast[47GGuard[53Gtold[58Ghim[62Ghis[66Gpost[71Gwas[75Gobsolete.[85GThey[90Goffered[98Ga[100Gpension[108Gand[112Ga[114Gseaside
[3Gcottage.[12GSilas[18Gsaid[23Ghe[26Gwould[32Gconsider[41Git.

[3GHe[6Gdid[10Gnot[14Gconsider[23Git.[27GHe[30Gkept[35Gclimbing.

[3GThe[7Gfinal[13Gwinter[20Gstorm[26Gcame[31Gin[34Gsideways,[44Grattling[53Gthe[57Gglass[63Gand[67Gthrowing[76Gspray[82Ghigh[87Genough[94Gto[97Gstrike[104Gthe[108Ggallery[116Grail.
[3GAt[6Gmidnight,[16Ga[18Gflare[24Gsputtered[34Gon[37Gthe[41Ghorizon:[50Ga[52Gsmall[58Gfishing[66Gboat,[72Gits[76Gengine[83Gdead,[89Gdrifting[98Gtoward[105Gthe[109Grocks.

[3GSilas's[11Ghands[17Gwere[22Gstiff,[29Gbut[33Ghe[36Gran[40Gthe[44Glamp[49Gby[52Ghand,[58Gturning[66Gthe[70Ggreat[76Glens[81Gtoward[88Gthe[92Gboat,[98Gagain[104Gand[108Gagain,[115Guntil
[3Gthe[7Gcrew's[14Gshouts[21Gcarried[29Gacross[36Gthe[40Gwaves.[47GTheir[53Gcaptain[61Gwaved[67Ga[69Glantern[77Gin[80Greply.[87GThen[92Gthe[96Gboat[101Gturned,[109Gfound[115Gthe
[3Gchannel,[12Gand[16Gslipped[24Gsafely[31Ginto[36Gthe[40Gharbor.

[3GThe[7Gnext[12Gmorning,[21Ga[23Gyoung[29Greporter[38Gcame[43Gto[46Gthe[50Gpoint[56Gand[60Gasked[66Gwhy[70Ghe[73Ghad[77Grefused[85Gto[88Gleave.

[3GSilas[9Glooked[16Gat[19Gthe[23Gsea,[28Gstill[34Ggray[39Gand[43Grestless.[53G"A[56Glight[62Gdoesn't[70Gknow[75Gwhen[80Git's[85Gneeded,"[94Ghe[97Gsaid.[103G"It[107Gjust[112Ghas[116Gto[119Gbe
[3Gthere[9Gwhen[14Git[17Gis."

[3GThat[8Gspring,[16Gthe[20Glighthouse[31Gwent[36Gdark[41Gfor[45Gthe[49Glast[54Gtime.[60GBut[64Gevery[70Gfisherman[80Gin[83Gthe[87Gvillage[95Gstill[101Glooked[108Gtoward[115GGrey
[3GPoint[9Gat[12Gdusk,[18Gand[22Gin[25Gtheir[31Ghearts,[39Gthe[43Glight[49Gkept[54Gburning.

